IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-periods`
IMPORT `sg-interests`
IMPORT `sgb2-s164-register-of-shareholdings`
IMPORT `sgb2-s164a-s165-disclosure`

-- Tests for ss 164A and 165. Every expected value is written from the text, beside the assertion, before it was run.

§ `Facts for the s 7 interest tests`

`s 165 test facts: no interest at all` MEANS `s 7 interest facts` WITH
    `the person has authority (formal or informal, express or implied) to dispose of, or to exercise control over the disposal of, the shares` IS FALSE
    `property held in trust consists of or includes the shares and the person has an interest under the trust` IS FALSE
    `the person knows, or has reasonable grounds for believing, that the person has that interest under the trust` IS FALSE
    `the person has entered into a contract to purchase a share` IS FALSE
    `the person has a right, otherwise than by reason of having an interest under a trust, to have a share transferred to the person or to the person's order` IS FALSE
    `the person has the right to acquire a share, or an interest in a share, under an option` IS FALSE
    `the person is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative at a meeting, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a share of which the person is not the registered holder` IS FALSE
    `the thing is a unit in a collective investment scheme that has been subscribed or purchased on an offer of units, or is issued for such an offer and held by the scheme's manager` IS FALSE
    `the person holds the share as bare trustee` IS FALSE
    `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money` IS FALSE
    `the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` IS FALSE
    `the person holds the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office` IS FALSE
    `the interest is a company's interest in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (including treasury shares)` IS FALSE
    `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons` IS FALSE
    `the bodies corporate through which the person may be deemed to have the interest` IS EMPTY

`s 165 test facts: a unit and a contract to purchase` MEANS `s 7 interest facts` WITH
    `the person has authority (formal or informal, express or implied) to dispose of, or to exercise control over the disposal of, the shares` IS FALSE
    `property held in trust consists of or includes the shares and the person has an interest under the trust` IS FALSE
    `the person knows, or has reasonable grounds for believing, that the person has that interest under the trust` IS FALSE
    `the person has entered into a contract to purchase a share` IS TRUE
    `the person has a right, otherwise than by reason of having an interest under a trust, to have a share transferred to the person or to the person's order` IS FALSE
    `the person has the right to acquire a share, or an interest in a share, under an option` IS FALSE
    `the person is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative at a meeting, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a share of which the person is not the registered holder` IS FALSE
    `the thing is a unit in a collective investment scheme that has been subscribed or purchased on an offer of units, or is issued for such an offer and held by the scheme's manager` IS TRUE
    `the person holds the share as bare trustee` IS FALSE
    `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money` IS FALSE
    `the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` IS FALSE
    `the person holds the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office` IS FALSE
    `the interest is a company's interest in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (including treasury shares)` IS FALSE
    `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons` IS FALSE
    `the bodies corporate through which the person may be deemed to have the interest` IS EMPTY

§ `s 164A(1): the notice and what the company must do`

-- (a) 10 of 100 members is at least 10%; 9 of 100 is not. (b) 5 of 100 shares is at least 5%; 4 of 100 is not.
#ASSERT `s 164A(1) the notice is one that the company must act on` TRUE TRUE 10 100 0 1000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1) the notice is one that the company must act on` TRUE TRUE 9 100 0 1000 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1) the notice is one that the company must act on` TRUE TRUE 1 100 50 1000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1) the notice is one that the company must act on` TRUE TRUE 1 100 49 1000 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Either limb is enough; neither is not.
#ASSERT `s 164A(1) the notice is one that the company must act on` TRUE TRUE 20 100 0 1000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not served, or a notice that does not require the emoluments of the directors to be disclosed.
#ASSERT `s 164A(1) the notice is one that the company must act on` FALSE TRUE 10 100 0 1000 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1) the notice is one that the company must act on` TRUE FALSE 10 100 0 1000 EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (c): 14 days or the longer period the Registrar allows (0 where none).
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(c) the number of days the company has to prepare the statement and cause it to be audited` 0 EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(c) the number of days the company has to prepare the statement and cause it to be audited` 10 EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(c) the number of days the company has to prepare the statement and cause it to be audited` 30 EQUALS 30
-- Served 1 June 2026: the 14th day is 15 June; with 30 days, 1 July.
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(c) the statement was prepared and audited in time` (Date 1 6 2026) 14 (Date 15 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(c) the statement was prepared and audited in time` (Date 1 6 2026) 14 (Date 16 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(c) the statement was prepared and audited in time` (Date 1 6 2026) 30 (Date 1 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (c): the contents. All four, or the paragraph is not met.
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(c) the statement is the statement the paragraph requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(c) the statement is the statement the paragraph requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(c) the statement is the statement the paragraph requires` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(c) the statement is the statement the paragraph requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(c) the statement is the statement the paragraph requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (d): audited 1 July 2026; 14 days after is 15 July; and to all persons entitled.
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(d) the company sent the copy of the audited statement in time to all the persons entitled` (Date 1 7 2026) (Date 15 7 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(d) the company sent the copy of the audited statement in time to all the persons entitled` (Date 1 7 2026) (Date 16 7 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(d) the company sent the copy of the audited statement in time to all the persons entitled` (Date 1 7 2026) (Date 15 7 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (e)
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(e) the company laid the audited statement before the next general meeting` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 164A(1)(e) the company laid the audited statement before the next general meeting` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- The three duties: in time, FULFILLED; late, BREACH; nothing done, RESIDUAL.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 164A(1)(c) the company must prepare the statement and cause it to be audited within the days allowed after it is served with the notice` "Acme Pte Ltd" 14 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 164A(1)(c) prepare the statement and cause it to be audited` AT 14

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 164A(1)(c) the company must prepare the statement and cause it to be audited within the days allowed after it is served with the notice` "Acme Pte Ltd" 14 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 164A(1)(c) prepare the statement and cause it to be audited` AT 15

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 164A(1)(c) the company must prepare the statement and cause it to be audited within the days allowed after it is served with the notice` "Acme Pte Ltd" 14 AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 164A(1)(d) the company must send a copy of the audited statement to all persons entitled to receive notice of general meetings within 14 days after the audit` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 164A(1)(d) send a copy of the audited statement to all persons entitled to receive notice of general meetings` AT 14

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 164A(1)(d) the company must send a copy of the audited statement to all persons entitled to receive notice of general meetings within 14 days after the audit` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 164A(1)(d) send a copy of the audited statement to all persons entitled to receive notice of general meetings` AT 15

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 164A(1)(d) the company must send a copy of the audited statement to all persons entitled to receive notice of general meetings within 14 days after the audit` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 164A(1)(e) the company must lay the audited statement before the next general meeting` "Acme Pte Ltd" 90 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 164A(1)(e) lay the audited statement before the next general meeting` AT 90

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 164A(1)(e) the company must lay the audited statement before the next general meeting` "Acme Pte Ltd" 90 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 164A(1)(e) lay the audited statement before the next general meeting` AT 91

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 164A(1)(e) the company must lay the audited statement before the next general meeting` "Acme Pte Ltd" 90 AT 0 WITH

§ `s 164A(2): the offence`

#ASSERT `s 164A(2) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 164A(2) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 164A(2) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 164A(2) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A fine not exceeding $10,000; no imprisonment.
#ASSERT `s 164A(2) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST (`s 164A(2) penalty` OF 10000, 0)
#ASSERT `s 164A(2) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST (`s 164A(2) penalty` OF 10000, 0)
#ASSERT `s 164A(2) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 165(1) and (10): who must give notice`

#ASSERT `s 165(10) subsection (1)(a) and (b) does not apply to the person` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(10) subsection (1)(a) and (b) does not apply to the person` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 165(10) subsection (1)(a) and (b) does not apply to the person` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (a) and (b): a director or chief executive officer, the particulars necessary and applicable, (10) not applying.
#ASSERT `s 165(1) the person must give the company written notice` `s 165(1)(a) the particulars relating to shares, debentures, participatory interests, rights, options and contracts` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(1) the person must give the company written notice` `s 165(1)(b) the particulars of a change in those particulars` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (10) applies: JUST FALSE, a flat negative.
#ASSERT `s 165(1) the person must give the company written notice` `s 165(1)(a) the particulars relating to shares, debentures, participatory interests, rights, options and contracts` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 165(1) the person must give the company written notice` `s 165(1)(b) the particulars of a change in those particulars` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (10) speaks of (1)(a) and (b) only; (c) is untouched.
#ASSERT `s 165(1) the person must give the company written notice` `s 165(1)(c) the events and matters affecting or relating to the person that the company needs for section 173A` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Particulars not necessary, or not applicable to the person: NOTHING (the duty is limited to those).
#ASSERT `s 165(1) the person must give the company written notice` `s 165(1)(a) the particulars relating to shares, debentures, participatory interests, rights, options and contracts` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 165(1) the person must give the company written notice` `s 165(1)(c) the events and matters affecting or relating to the person that the company needs for section 173A` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not a director or chief executive officer: the section says nothing of the person.
#ASSERT `s 165(1) the person must give the company written notice` `s 165(1)(a) the particulars relating to shares, debentures, participatory interests, rights, options and contracts` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Another kind of notice: the list is not closed.
#ASSERT `s 165(1) the person must give the company written notice` `s 165(1) some other notice` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 165(2): within 2 business days`

-- (a) whichever last occurs.
#ASSERT `s 165(2)(a) the date from which the 2 business days run` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 5 6 2026) EQUALS Date 5 6 2026
#ASSERT `s 165(2)(a) the date from which the 2 business days run` (Date 5 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS Date 5 6 2026
-- 1 January 2026 is a Thursday: the 2nd business day after it is Monday 5 January.
#ASSERT `s 165(2) the last day for the notice` (Date 1 1 2026) EMPTY EQUALS Date 5 1 2026
-- 2 January 2026 is a Friday: with no holiday the 2nd business day after is Tuesday 6 January; with Monday 5 January a public holiday, Wednesday 7 January.
#ASSERT `s 165(2) the last day for the notice` (Date 2 1 2026) EMPTY EQUALS Date 6 1 2026
#ASSERT `s 165(2) the last day for the notice` (Date 2 1 2026) (LIST (Date 5 1 2026)) EQUALS Date 7 1 2026
-- 9 January 2026 is a Friday: Monday 12 and Tuesday 13 are the 1st and 2nd business days.
#ASSERT `s 165(2) the last day for the notice` (Date 9 1 2026) EMPTY EQUALS Date 13 1 2026
#ASSERT `s 165(2) the number of days from the day the 2 business days run from to the last day for the notice` (Date 1 1 2026) EMPTY EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `s 165(2) the number of days from the day the 2 business days run from to the last day for the notice` (Date 2 1 2026) (LIST (Date 5 1 2026)) EQUALS 5
-- (a): in time up to and including the last day, and on the day of the event itself.
#ASSERT `s 165(2)(a) the notice of the particulars was given within 2 business days` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 5 1 2026) EMPTY EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(2)(a) the notice of the particulars was given within 2 business days` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) EMPTY EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(2)(a) the notice of the particulars was given within 2 business days` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 6 1 2026) EMPTY EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A public holiday is not counted: with 5 January a holiday, 6 January is in time for an event on 1 January.
#ASSERT `s 165(2)(a) the notice of the particulars was given within 2 business days` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 6 1 2026) (LIST (Date 5 1 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(2)(b) the notice of the change was given within 2 business days` (Date 2 1 2026) (Date 6 1 2026) EMPTY EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(2)(b) the notice of the change was given within 2 business days` (Date 2 1 2026) (Date 7 1 2026) EMPTY EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (1)(a) with (2)(a): the 4 calendar days from Thursday 1 January to Monday 5 January.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 165(1)(a) and (2)(a) the director or chief executive officer must give the company written notice of the particulars within 2 business days` "Dana Tan" FALSE 4 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Dana Tan" DOES `s 165(1)(a) give the company written notice of the particulars relating to shares, debentures, participatory interests, rights, options and contracts` AT 4

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 165(1)(a) and (2)(a) the director or chief executive officer must give the company written notice of the particulars within 2 business days` "Dana Tan" FALSE 4 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Dana Tan" DOES `s 165(1)(a) give the company written notice of the particulars relating to shares, debentures, participatory interests, rights, options and contracts` AT 5

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 165(1)(a) and (2)(a) the director or chief executive officer must give the company written notice of the particulars within 2 business days` "Dana Tan" FALSE 4 AT 0 WITH

-- (10) applies: nothing is owed under (1)(a) and (b).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 165(1)(a) and (2)(a) the director or chief executive officer must give the company written notice of the particulars within 2 business days` "Dana Tan" TRUE 4 AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 165(1)(b) and (2)(b) the director or chief executive officer must give the company written notice of the change within 2 business days` "Dana Tan" FALSE 4 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Dana Tan" DOES `s 165(1)(b) give the company written notice of the particulars of the change` AT 2

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 165(1)(b) and (2)(b) the director or chief executive officer must give the company written notice of the change within 2 business days` "Dana Tan" FALSE 4 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Dana Tan" DOES `s 165(1)(b) give the company written notice of the particulars of the change` AT 6

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 165(1)(b) and (2)(b) the director or chief executive officer must give the company written notice of the change within 2 business days` "Dana Tan" FALSE 4 AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 165(1)(b) and (2)(b) the director or chief executive officer must give the company written notice of the change within 2 business days` "Dana Tan" TRUE 4 AT 0 WITH

-- (1)(c) has no period in (2): it can be done or not done, never late.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 165(1)(c) the director or chief executive officer must give the company written notice of the events and matters` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Dana Tan" DOES `s 165(1)(c) give the company written notice of the events and matters affecting or relating to the person` AT 1

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 165(1)(c) the director or chief executive officer must give the company written notice of the events and matters` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH

§ `s 165(3): the company passes the notice on, within 7 days`

-- Received 1 March 2026: the 7th day is 8 March.
#ASSERT `s 165(3) the company sent a copy of the notice to each of the other directors and chief executive officers in time` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 8 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(3) the company sent a copy of the notice to each of the other directors and chief executive officers in time` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 9 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 165(3) the company sent a copy of the notice to each of the other directors and chief executive officers in time` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 8 3 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 165(3) the company must send a copy of the notice to each of the other directors and chief executive officers within 7 days` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 165(3) send a copy of the notice to each of the other directors and chief executive officers` AT 7

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 165(3) the company must send a copy of the notice to each of the other directors and chief executive officers within 7 days` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 165(3) send a copy of the notice to each of the other directors and chief executive officers` AT 8

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 165(3) the company must send a copy of the notice to each of the other directors and chief executive officers within 7 days` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH

§ `s 165(4) and (5): the defence of not being aware, and the presumption of awareness`

-- (4): the defendant proves the failure was due to not being aware; not aware on the date of the summons.
#ASSERT `s 165(4) the section gives the defendant a defence on these facts` `s 165(4) a failure to comply with subsection (1)(a)` TRUE FALSE 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(4) the section gives the defendant a defence on these facts` `s 165(4) a failure to comply with subsection (1)(b)` TRUE FALSE 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(4) the section gives the defendant a defence on these facts` `s 165(4) a failure to comply with subsection (2)` TRUE FALSE 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Became aware 6 days before the summons: less than 7, so a defence; 7 days: not less than 7.
#ASSERT `s 165(4) the section gives the defendant a defence on these facts` `s 165(4) a failure to comply with subsection (1)(a)` TRUE TRUE 6 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(4) the section gives the defendant a defence on these facts` `s 165(4) a failure to comply with subsection (1)(a)` TRUE TRUE 7 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not proved: no defence on these facts.
#ASSERT `s 165(4) the section gives the defendant a defence on these facts` `s 165(4) a failure to comply with subsection (1)(a)` FALSE FALSE 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3) and (1)(c) are not among the failures the subsection names: it says nothing of them.
#ASSERT `s 165(4) the section gives the defendant a defence on these facts` `s 165(4) another failure` TRUE FALSE 0 EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 165(5) the person is conclusively presumed to have been aware of the fact or occurrence at that time` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(5) the person is conclusively presumed to have been aware of the fact or occurrence at that time` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(5) the person is conclusively presumed to have been aware of the fact or occurrence at that time` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 165(5) the person is conclusively presumed to have been aware of the fact or occurrence at that time` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 165(6) to (8): terms, interests, and matters already in the old register`

#ASSERT `s 165(6)(a) the thing is a participatory interest` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(6)(a) the thing is a participatory interest` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 165(6)(b) the person is a person who holds or acquires shares, debentures or participatory interests or an interest in them` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(6)(b) the person is a person who holds or acquires shares, debentures or participatory interests or an interest in them` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 165(7) the person has an interest in the debenture or participatory interest` `s 165 test facts: no interest at all` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 165(7) the person has an interest in the debenture or participatory interest` `s 165 test facts: a unit and a contract to purchase` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(8) section 164 and this section do not require the matter to be entered in the register or notified to the company` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(8) section 164 and this section do not require the matter to be entered in the register or notified to the company` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 165(9): the offences`

#ASSERT `s 165(9) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(9) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 165(9) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 165(9) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST (`s 165(9) penalty` OF 15000, 3, 1000)
#ASSERT `s 165(9) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST (`s 165(9) penalty` OF 15000, 3, 1000)
#ASSERT `s 165(9) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
